### Response
### Status Code: 400
### Body: {"Error": "Invalid request"}
PUT http://localhost:3000/musics/{{DEADLIFT_ID}} HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
    "name": "Deadlift",
    "reps": 12,
    "weight": 25,
    "unit": "kgs"
